    {
      "text": "In hot places, its internal gases could expand and explode without any warning. Be very careful!",
      "version": "lets-go-eevee"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is full of poisonous gas. It floats into garbage dumps, seeking out the fumes of raw, rotting trash.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It adores polluted air. Some claim that Koffing used to be more plentiful in the Galar region than they are now.",
      "version": "shield"
    }
